'''Scarred Guts''' are paler versions of the regular Guts. They have a 50% chance of replacing normal Guts in the {{s|Scarred Womb}}. They behave identically to regular Guts but leave behind a trail of damaging [[Creep#Red Creep|Red Creep]] and move slightly faster than their regular counterparts.
