=== Slog ===
{{infobox monster
 | dlc         = r
 | name        = Slog
 | variant     = 2
 | base hp     = 28
 | environment = {{floor|Dank Depths}}<br>{{room|challenge}}
 | behavior    = Attaches itself to a wall or obstacle and rolls around it, charging at Isaac when he is in sight.
}}

'''Slogs''' are much darker than Guts and bear a yellow eye in their center that follows Isaac's position. Initially, they behave identically to Guts while moving slightly slower and leaving behind a trail of slowing [[Creep#Black Creep|Black Creep]]. However, when Isaac cardinally aligns with them, they charge at him until colliding with a wall or obstacle, where they will then resume their previous behavior. Slogs are exclusive to the {{s|Dank Depths}}.
{{clear}}

=== Cyst ===
{{infobox monster
 | dlc         = r
 | name        = Cyst
